  motivations: "She loves taking photographs, especially of nature. For her this
    is a disconnection from the real world and an approach to what she wants to be,
    one more in the\_cycle\_of\_life."
  background: "As a child she lived in the big city of near VillAI island but as
    she got older she understood that for her that city was a cage. When she freed
    himself, he discovered the challenges that the outside world offered him and
    she\_was\_excited."
  speechStyle: 1
  otherInfo: She is currently going through difficult times as her work as a woodcutter
    comes into conflict with her love for nature, although little by little she will
    realize that her thoughts and actions are not so contradictory.
